nks @straight-shoota)\r\n- _(networking)_ **[security]** Fix do not automatically decompress HTTP request body ([#17476], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n- _(serialization)_ Fix `XML::Node#namespace` for node types without namespace ([#17435], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n- _(serialization)_ Fix `YAML::Any#hash` with self-referencing containers ([#17477], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n\r\n[#17296]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17296\r\n[#17434]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17434\r\n[#17435]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17435\r\n[#17436]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17436\r\n[#17466]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17466\r\n[#17476]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17476\r\n[#17477]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17477\r\n\r\n### Infrastructure\r\n\r\n- Add changelog for 1.21.1 ([#17478], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n- Update distribution-scripts ([#17480], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n\r\n[#17478]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17478\r\n[#17480]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17480\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/crystal-lang/crystal/releases/397215446/reactions","total_count":20,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":2,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":8,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":2}